{'symbol': 'AMD', 'date': '2023-04-19 17:00:00', 'title': "AMD AND SAP'S 25-YEAR PARTNERSHIP REACHES NEW HEIGHTS WITH SUCCESSFUL MIGRATION TO SAP S/4HANA®", 'text': "WALLDORF, GERMANY , APRIL 19, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SAP SE (NYSE: SAP) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT AMD (NASDAQ: AMD), A LEADER IN HIGH-PERFORMANCE AND ADAPTIVE COMPUTING, HAS SUCCESSFULLY MIGRATED TO SAP S/4HANA® CLOUD, PRIVATE EDITION. THIS MARKS A MAJOR MILESTONE IN THE AMD DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION JOURNEY AND STRENGTHENS THE TWO COMPANIES' LONG-STANDING STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP."}